<title>USA: Prentiss completes $41.1 mln acquisition.</title>
<headline>Prentiss completes $41.1 mln acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prentiss Properties Trust said on Wednesday it acquired two Class-A suburban office buildings in Herndon, Virginia for $41.1 million.</p>
<p>Since its October 1996 initial public offering, Prentiss Properties Trust has acquired eight buildings -- five suburban office and three industrial properties -- for a total of $120 million.</p>
<p>Prentiss Properties Trust is a self-administered and self-managed real estate investment trust (&quot;REIT&quot;) formed to continue and expand the national office and industrial businesses of the Prentiss Group.</p>
</text>
